			          morning were the sixth day. Genesis 1:27-31', '2026-01-28 21:21:36');
INSERT INTO answers (id, contradiction_id, answer, answer_explanation, created_at) VALUES (36, 16, 'Plants were created after humans.', 'These are the generations of the heavens and of the earth ... And
			          every plant of the field before it was in the earth, and every herb of
			          the field before it grew: for the LORD God had not caused it to rain
			          upon the earth, and there was not a man to till the ground. But there
