Jehoiada took for him two wives.... 2 Chronicles 24:3', '2026-01-28 21:21:36');
INSERT INTO answers (id, contradiction_id, answer, answer_explanation, created_at) VALUES (58, 27, 'No, the Bible disapproves of polygamy', 'The LORD God caused a deep sleep to fall upon Adam, and he slept: and he took one of his ribs, 
				        and closed up the flesh instead thereof;  And the rib, which the LORD God had taken from man, 
