For I am the Lord, I change not. Malachi 3:6

With whom is no variableness, neither shadow of turning. James 1:17', '2026-01-28 21:21:36');
INSERT INTO answers (id, contradiction_id, answer, answer_explanation, created_at) VALUES (75, 34, 'Yes, God repents.', 'And it repented the Lord that he had made man on the earth, and it grieved him at his heart. Genesis 6:6', '2026-01-28 21:21:36');
INSERT INTO answers (id, contradiction_id, answer, answer_explanation, created_at) VALUES (76, 34, 'Maybe he''ll repent, maybe he won''t', 'Who knoweth if he [God] will return and repent. Joel 2:14

