Thou shalt swear, The LORD liveth. Jeremiah 4:2
				
				
Swear by my name, The LORD liveth. Jeremiah 12:16', '2026-01-28 21:21:36');
INSERT INTO answers (id, contradiction_id, answer, answer_explanation, created_at) VALUES (157, 72, 'No.', 'But I say unto you, swear not at all; neither by heaven
				          for it is God''s throne; nor by the earth for it is his
