				        shall all the nations of the earth be blessed. Genesis 26:4', '2026-01-28 21:21:36');
INSERT INTO answers (id, contradiction_id, answer, answer_explanation, created_at) VALUES (168, 77, 'No, at least not if one of them makes a graven image.', 'Take heed unto yourselves, lest ye forget ... 
